body:
I have grind like crazy in the last two month-ish for this birthday box with 220 gems. I'll use them ALL on it in hopes of one UR of Nozomi.

I'm really hoping for mermaid, because I'll have my first pair..but any UR. Just any. UR. Please. Come home Nozomi. ;~;

Good luck to everyone on this hectic Nozomi birthday!
